                                                      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                                      "args": {
                                                        "text": [
                                                          "Slush: I still\nprefer a building\nwith my name on\nit. But a city\nthat works is a",
                                                          "better neighbor\nthan an estate\nsurrounded by\ncold. He offers\nthe umbrella to",
                                                          "Pip, who discovers\nit is heavy\nbecause the handle\nstores twelve\nemergency forms."
                                                        ],
